4is2Hgehw|160#90#179#5#5#10000#M$M#rs$AOn4CLAOa4JeuhwBuADB0UuXj4KFsmdOag|320#180#179#3#3#10000#M$M#rs$AOn4CLCsLlCmTyHfLRR-_m9nBeRvj65ZHw","recommendedLevel":3,"fineScrubbingRecommendedLevel":2,"highResolutionRecommendedLevel":3}},"microformat":{"playerMicroformatRenderer":{"thumbnail":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/lBUr8DGSj-U/maxresdefault.jpg","width":1280,"height":720}]},"embed":{"iframeUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/lBUr8DGSj-U","width":1280,"height":720},"title":{"simpleText":"I asked 100 FPL Experts for their Gameweek 1 teams, and this is what I found out... | FPL 2026/27"},"description":{"simpleText":"Win your league or your money back 👉 https://go.fantasyfootballhub.co.uk/landing/fplmate?utm_source=affiliate\u0026utm_medium=affiliates\u0026utm_campaign=FPLMate\u0026utm_content=youtube\u0026via=FPLMate #ad\n\nWelcome to THE BIG Fantasy Premier League video for GW1, 2026/27!\n\nI asked 100 FPL experts, podcasters, bloggers, writers and YouTubers to send me their gameweek 1 squad drafts. I recorded all of the data from all 100 teams, so I could work out a bunch of information that I could share with you. We have found out who the most popular players are, which formation is the most popular, who is most popular captain, and much more.\n\n0:00 Intro\n0:52 Goalkeepers\n3:59 Defenders\n8:05 Midfielders\n10:54 Forwards\n13:21 Top picks\n14:57 Formations\n15:52 Key decisions\n22:00 Overrated picks\n25:22 Underrated picks\n26:42 GW1 Captains\n\nIf you like what you see, subscribe and become my latest mate!\n\n📧 Business enquiries: dan@fplmate.co.uk\n\n🐦 https://www.twitter.com/FPLMate\n📸 https://www.instagram.com/FPLMate\n🎙️ Podcast: linktr.ee/sticktofpl\n🎶 https://www.tiktok.com/@FPLMate\n🎮 https://www.twitch.tv/fpl_mate\n👾 https://discord.gg/rfVSeftbmx\n🏆 Join: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCweDAlFm2LnVcOqaFU4_AGA/join\n️⚽️ FPL Mate league link: https://fantasy.premierleague.com/leagues/auto-join/kxxssl\n️⚽️ FPL Mate league code: kxxssl\n\n#f